WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.017 --> 00:00:02.884
[Rapid beeping]

00:00:02.884 --> 00:00:03.884
[Ding]

00:00:05.259 --> 00:00:06.259
LOKI
[Grunts]

00:00:07.906 --> 00:00:09.906
LOKI
I know what this place is.

00:00:09.906 --> 00:00:11.678
♪♪

00:00:14.472 --> 00:00:16.886
The timekeepers have
built quite the circus.

00:00:18.347 --> 00:00:21.758
And I see the clowns are playing
their parts to perfection.

00:00:24.253 --> 00:00:26.633
MOBIUS
Big metaphor guy. I love it.

00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:28.094
Makes you sound
super smart.

00:00:28.118 --> 00:00:29.149
LOKI
I am smart.

00:00:29.149 --> 00:00:29.946
MOBIUS
I know.

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:30.696
LOKI
Okay.

00:00:30.696 --> 00:00:31.865
MOBIUS
Okay.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:33.617
LOKI
[Screaming]

00:00:39.998 --> 00:00:40.832
TVA AGENT
Please sign to verify

00:00:40.832 --> 00:00:42.459
this is everything
you've ever said.

00:00:42.967 --> 00:00:44.127
LOKI
This is absurd.

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:46.500
[Printer prints out a page]

00:00:47.748 --> 00:00:49.132
TVA AGENT
Sign this too.

00:00:50.868 --> 00:00:53.535
♪♪

00:00:53.535 --> 00:00:57.307
MOBIUS
We protect the proper flow of time.

00:00:59.457 --> 00:01:02.418
You picked up the Tesseract,
breaking reality.

00:01:03.652 --> 00:01:05.652
I want you to
help us fix it.

00:01:07.813 --> 00:01:08.423
LOKI
Why me?

00:01:08.423 --> 00:01:11.048
MOBIUS
I need your unique Loki perspective.

00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:12.915
LOKI
Do I get a weapon?

00:01:12.915 --> 00:01:13.865
MOBIUS
Nah.

00:01:17.053 --> 00:01:19.062
♪♪

00:01:22.037 --> 00:01:24.248
TVA JUDGE
You really believe in this Loki variant?

00:01:26.241 --> 00:01:27.822
MOBIUS
Luckily, he believes in himself enough

00:01:27.822 --> 00:01:29.047
for the both of us.

00:01:31.295 --> 00:01:31.883
LOKI
Bye.

00:01:33.443 --> 00:01:37.474
It is adorable, that you
think you could possibly...

00:01:37.474 --> 00:01:38.974
...manipulate me.

00:01:42.858 --> 00:01:44.813
LOKI
I'm ten steps ahead of you.

00:01:46.725 --> 00:01:48.731
MOBIUS
You're not big on trust, are you?

00:01:48.731 --> 00:01:51.076
♪♪

00:01:52.451 --> 00:01:53.959
LOKI
You can trust me.

00:01:53.959 --> 00:01:55.824
MOBIUS
Loki, I have studied almost every moment

00:01:55.824 --> 00:01:57.105
of your entire life.

00:01:57.105 --> 00:02:00.331
You've literally stabbed
people in the back like fifty times.

00:02:01.871 --> 00:02:03.457
LOKI
Well, I'd never do it again!

00:02:05.379 --> 00:02:08.300
♪♪

